async function investigationAction(request:Request,env:Env,context:SessionContext){if(!allowed(context,'bakery.investigation','edit'))return json({error:'Bakery Investigation Edit permission is required.'},403);let body:Record<string,unknown>;try{body=await request.json()}catch{return json({error:'Invalid investigation action.'},400)}const exceptionId=text(body.exceptionId,120),action=text(body.action,30),note=text(body.note,1200);const found=await env.DB.prepare(`SELECT id,status,resolved_by AS resolvedBy FROM bakery_accountability_exceptions WHERE id=? AND company_id=?`).bind(exceptionId,COMPANY).first<{id:string;status:string;resolvedBy:string|null}>();if(!found)return json({error:'Bakery accountability exception not found.'},404);const statements:D1PreparedStatement[]=[];if(action==='assign'){const employeeId=text(body.employeeId,120);const employee=await env.DB.prepare(`SELECT e.id FROM employees e JOIN employee_company_assignments a ON a.employee_id=e.id WHERE e.id=? AND a.company_id=? AND a.status='active' AND e.status='active'`).bind(employeeId,COMPANY).first();if(!employee)return json({error:'Assignee must be an active employee assigned to Daenem Bakery.'},400);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`UPDATE bakery_accountability_exceptions SET assigned_to=?,assigned_by=?,assigned_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,status=CASE WHEN status='open' THEN 'investigating' ELSE status END,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id=?`).bind(employeeId,context.employee.id,exceptionId))}else if(action==='add_evidence'){const evidenceType=text(body.evidenceType,30);if(!['note','receipt','photo','document','witness','system_record','other'].includes(evidenceType)||!note)return json({error:'Evidence type and a clear description are required.'},400);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`INSERT INTO bakery_exception_evidence(id,exception_id,company_id,evidence_type,description,file_path,reference,recorded_by) VALUES(?,?,?,?,?,?,?,?)`).bind(uid('exception-evidence'),exceptionId,COMPANY,evidenceType,note,text(body.filePath,500)||null,text(body.reference,200)||null,context.employee.id),env.DB.prepare(`UPDATE bakery_accountability_exceptions SET status='investigating',updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id=?`).bind(exceptionId))}else if(action==='resolve'){if(!note)return json({error:'Resolution explanation is required.'},400);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`UPDATE bakery_accountability_exceptions SET status='investigating',resolution_note=?,resolved_by=?,resolved_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,resolution_approved_by=NULL,resolution_approved_at=NULL,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id=?`).bind(note,context.employee.id,exceptionId))}else if(action==='approve_resolution'){if(!allowed(context,'bakery.investigation','approve'))return json({error:'Bakery Investigation Approve permission is required.'},403);if(!found.resolvedBy)return json({error:'An investigator must submit a resolution before approval.'},409);if(found.resolvedBy===context.employee.id)return json({error:'The employee who resolved an exception cannot approve the same resolution.'},409);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`UPDATE bakery_accountability_exceptions SET status='resolved',resolution_approved_by=?,resolution_approved_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id=?`).bind(context.employee.id,exceptionId))}else if(action==='dismiss'){if(!allowed(context,'bakery.investigation','approve')||!note)return json({error:'Approve permission and a dismissal reason are required.'},403);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`UPDATE bakery_accountability_exceptions SET status='dismissed',resolution_note=?,resolved_by=?,resolved_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,resolution_approved_by=?,resolution_approved_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id=?`).bind(note,context.employee.id,context.employee.id,exceptionId))}else if(action==='reopen'){if(!allowed(context,'bakery.investigation','approve')||!note)return json({error:'Approve permission and a reopening reason are required.'},403);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`UPDATE bakery_accountability_exceptions SET status='investigating',resolution_note=?,resolved_by=NULL,resolved_at=NULL,resolution_approved_by=NULL,resolution_approved_at=NULL,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id=?`).bind(note,exceptionId))}else return json({error:'Choose assign, add evidence, resolve, approve resolution, dismiss or reopen.'},400);statements.push(env.DB.prepare(`INSERT INTO audit_logs(id,actor_employee_id,company_id,module,action,entity_type,entity_id,after_json,source,request_id) VALUES(?,?,?,'bakery',?,'bakery_accountability_exception',?,?,'web',?)`).bind(uid('audit'),context.employee.id,COMPANY,`investigation_${action}`,exceptionId,JSON.stringify({note:note||undefined,employeeId:body.employeeId||undefined}),requestCorrelationId(request)));await env.DB.batch(statements);return json({ok:true,exceptionId,action})}

